tion: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; background-color: rgb(24, 35, 63); padding: 28px 32px; border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(42, 58, 98); border-radius: 18px; opacity: 1; isolation: isolate; box-sizing: border-box;"><div data-text-path="2.1.2.0" data-node-path="2.1.2.0" role="heading" aria-level="3" style="font-family: &quot;Space Grotesk&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(238, 242, 250); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-wrap-style: pretty; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0px 0px 12px; overflow-y: visible; box-sizing: border-box;">3 · Dynamic risk scoring &amp; prediction</div><div data-text-path="2.1.2.1" data-node-path="2.1.2.1" style="font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.45; color: rgb(169, 182, 211); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-wrap-style: pretty; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; overflow-y: visible;">A live Fire Hazard Score (0–100) for 4 environments, with a 60-second forecast.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
