<section class="deck-slide" id="6" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 6 of 7" data-document-role="page" data-label="It learns from each fire, within strict rules" data-speaker-notes="Left: the mission readiness score combines how well the agent contains the fire, the strength of the related experiments and how bad the fire would be with no agent. Below it, agent memory: each action's weight comes from experiment scores (SOFIE-MIST 9/10 gives 0.90, FLEX 7/10 gives 0.70, engineering practice is neutral at 0.60), and a simple learning step nudges choices toward what worked. Right: the guardrails that keep a superintelligent agent safe and honest, plus live status and failure handling. Nothing here controls real hardware."><div class="deck-fit"><div class="deck-scaler"><div style="width: 1920px; height: 1080px; position: relative; background: rgb(17, 26, 48); overflow: clip; contain: paint;" class="slide" data-canvas-width="1920" data-canvas-height="1080"><div data-frame-id="e0-e7m0kr" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><div data-node-path="" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 80px 112px; box-sizing: border-box;"><div data-text-path="0" data-node-path="0" style="font-family: &quot;Space Grotesk&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; color: rgb(169, 182, 211); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-wrap-style: pretty; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; letter-spacing: 3.6px; text-transform: uppercase; overflow-y: visible;">Feature 2 · Memory, readiness &amp; guardrails</div><div data-text-path="1" data-node-path="1" role="heading" aria-level="2" style="font-family: &quot;Space Grotesk&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(238, 242, 250); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-