ne-height: 1.2; color: rgb(238, 242, 250); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-wrap-style: pretty; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; overflow-y: visible; box-sizing: border-box;"><ul data-css-list="" style="margin: 0px; list-style-type: disc; padding-inline-start: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><li>Standby until an alarm; <font color="#eef2fa" style="color: rgb(238, 242, 250); -webkit-text-fill-color: currentcolor;"><b>no inert gas until the crew is clear</b></font>; act only if it cuts damage 15%.</li><li>If an action fails it is marked unavailable, logged, and the next best action is chosen.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="deck-slide" id="7" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 7 of 7" data-document-role="page" data-label="Watching every cabin and predicting what's next" data-speaker-notes="The final piece is the Dynamic Risk Scoring Engine. The SI agent watches simulated cabin sensors for all four environments: pressure, oxygen, airflow, distance to heat source and material flammability. It updates a live Fire Hazard Score, raises advisories and alarms on its own, and can auto-launch the fire simulation on a critical alarm. The prediction panel forecasts the next 60 seconds and reports its own accuracy. The score is a transparent, rule-based model that follows the direction of the NASA experiments, so every number can be explained. Thank you, we're happy to take questions."><div class="deck-fit"><div class="deck-scaler"><div style="width: 1920px; height: 1080px; position: relative; background: rgb(11, 18, 34); overflow: clip; contain: paint;" class="slide" data-canvas-width="1920" data-canvas-height="1080"><div data-frame-id="e0-1vgyk8a" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><div data-node-path="" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 80px 112px; box-sizing: border-box;"><div data-text-path="0" data-node-path="0" style="font-family: &quot;Space Grotesk&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; color: rgb(169, 182, 211); margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-wrap-style: pretty; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-shrink: 0; letter-spacing: 3.6px; text-transform: uppercase; overflow-y: visible;">Feature 3 · Dynamic risk scoring &amp; prediction</div><div data-text-path="1" data-node-path="1" role="heading" aria-level="2" style="font-family: &quot;Space Grotesk&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(238, 